      "message": "\u003e Could we add something to the cbmem, SMBios info, or ACPI tables (SSDT)?\n\n\nI think the issue here is that the MUX configuration can change in depthcharge after SMBIOS and ACPI tables are created in coreboot.\n\nVijay/Divya -- I am curious to understand why kernel requires the MUX configuration information done by the BIOS? What are the issues that you are running into? Do you have a bug where you have described the issue?",
      "parentUuid": "954c0bc5_fcb2bb6d",
